{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2020"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/film","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__film.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",132],["-","tour;"],["+","comeback"],["=",1],["+","tour, filmed by Reiner himself as a starstruck documentary maker; "],["=",595],["+"," A biopic need not cover a whole life: Walter Salles's “The Motorcycle Diaries” (2004) tells only of the nine-month journey through South America that the medical student Ernesto Guevara (Gael García Bernal) made with his friend Alberto Granado in 1952, long before he became the Marxist icon “Che”."],["=",318]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",130],["-","Amerika-Tournee"],["+","Comeback-Tournee"],["=",1],["-","begleitet;"],["+","durch"],["=",1],["+","Amerika begleitet, gefilmt von Reiner selbst in "],["=",2],["+","Rolle eines schwärmerischen Dokumentarfilmers; der "],["=",539],["+"," Ein Biopic muss nicht ein ganzes Leben erzählen: Walter Salles’ „Die Reise des jungen Che“ (2004) schildert nur die neunmonatige Südamerika-Reise, die der Medizinstudent Ernesto Guevara (Gael García Bernal) 1952 mit seinem Freund Alberto Granado unternahm – lange bevor er als „Che“ zur marxistischen Ikone wurde."],["=",304]]}]},
